      "title": "Bhagdei जामगढ़-भगदेई (District Raisen, Madhya Pradesh). Rock inscription dated saṃvat 1253.",
      "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.447273",
      "publication_date": "2017-04-04",
      "description": "<p>Bhagdei भगदेई (District Raisen, Madhya Pradesh). Rock inscription to the east of the village, near feet engraved on natural rock face, sometimes identified as <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.494366\">Viṣṇupada or जामवंतजी के चरणों</a>, likely dated saṃvat 1253 (<em>circa</em>&nbsp;CE 1196-97), as documented 2008&nbsp;&copy; Directorate of Archaeology, Museums and Archives, Madhya Pradesh.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Coordinates: &nbsp;</strong><a href=\"http://wikimapia.org/#lang=en&amp;lat=23.107622&amp;lon=78.258684&amp;z=17&amp;m=bs&amp;show=/36620884/%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%97%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%88-Bhagdei-Pillar\">23&deg;6&#39;29&quot;N&nbsp;78&deg;15&#39;18&quot;E</a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Survey of India</strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1433778\">Sheet 55I8 1973 1st Edition</a></p>\n\n<p>Selected bibliography:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>unpublished (2023)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "access_right": "open",
